<Slide style={{ width:'1280px', height:'720px', padding:'60px', background:'#FFFFFF', fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei', display:'flex', flexDirection:'column' }}>
<Box style={{ height:46, flexDirection:'row', alignItems:'center', justifyContent:'space-between' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection:'row', alignItems:'baseline', gap:18 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>用户文档与八屏操作</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#5A6B61', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>第 7 章 · 基于高保真交互原型 v1.2</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection:'row', alignItems:'center', gap:12 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5A6B61', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>FTDMS · 总体设计报告</Text><Image src="assets/logo_icon.png" style={{ width: 36, height: 36, objectFit: 'contain' }} /></Box></Box>
<Box style={{ height:1, background:'#CFD9D2', marginTop:8, marginBottom:20 }}></Box>
<Box style={{ height:462, flexDirection:'column', gap:18 }}><Box style={{ height:240, flexDirection:'row', gap:36 }}><Box style={{ flex:1, flexDirection:'column', gap:10, padding:'0 4px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>用户角色与使用场景</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>U1 普通用户：训练后记组次、用餐后录克重、晨起称重、周末看趋势<br />U2 管理员：新增动作、修正食物营养值、停用违规账户<br />用户代表：按 8 屏逐页走查，核对空状态与错误提示<br />权限边界：管理员不查看用户私有记录与分析报告</Text></Box><Box style={{ flex:1, flexDirection:'column', gap:10, padding:'0 4px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>登录与七项底栏</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>登录：体验完整数据 / 从空账户开始，原型不连真实网络<br />今日：能量环、三大营养素、今日计划与体重摘要<br />训练 / 饮食：计划与记录分离；按餐次录入、换算同屏<br />AI 分析居中凸起；体重 / 统计 / 我的承载记录、趋势与目标</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height:204, flexDirection:'column', gap:0 }}><Box style={{ height:51, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', borderBottom:'1px solid #CFD9D2', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 150 }}>登录失败</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>统一提示「账号或口令错误」，不区分账号是否存在，避免账号枚举</Text></Box><Box style={{ height:51, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', borderBottom:'1px solid #CFD9D2', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 150 }}>保存失败</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>多为业务码非 0，查看字段提示与 traceId，先刷新确认再重试</Text></Box><Box style={{ height:51, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', borderBottom:'1px solid #CFD9D2', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 150 }}>AI 授权与隐私</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>范围固定身体 / 饮食 / 训练 30 天，可随时撤回；模型无数据库直连权限</Text></Box><Box style={{ height:51, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 150 }}>缺失数据</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>统计页缺失日留白并标注「未记录」，另显有效天数，不按 0 绘图</Text></Box></Box></Box>
<Box style={{ height:50, marginTop:9, background:'#F4F8F5', flexDirection:'row', alignItems:'center', padding:'0 20px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>用户文档的操作路径、术语与提示文案与实际页面一致，可直接按章导出成册。</Text></Box>
</Slide>
